  nonce: c2fc  # c2fc
  message: "Routed to the owner rather than worked: the two remedies (a fourth adjudication category confined to the measurement instrument, versus a barrier at the config-deserialization boundary in the taint model itself) differ by an order of magnitude in blast radius, and the second changes what users are shown. Neither should be picked by the agent. Not gating anything in the current campaign -- P4 and P5 proceed regardless -- but it should be settled BEFORE the next precision measurement is designed, because a config-heavy repo could make that measurement mostly a statement about this class."  # c2fc
